{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":108,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"A Song. A Psalm by David."},{"n":1,"text":"My heart is steadfast, God. I will sing and I will make music with my soul.","tok":[{"t":"My","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" heart "},{"t":"is","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" steadfast, God. I "},{"t":"will","s":["H7892"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sing","s":["H7892"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"and","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" I "},{"t":"will","s":["H7892"]},{"t":" make "},{"t":"music","s":["H7892"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"with","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" soul."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Wake up, harp and lyre! I will wake up the dawn.","tok":[{"t":"Wake up, harp "},{"t":"and","s":["H3820"]},{"t":" lyre! "},{"t":"I","s":["H3559"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H3820"]},{"t":" wake up "},{"t":"the","s":["H3559"]},{"t":" dawn."}]},{"n":3,"text":"I will give thanks to you, LORD, among the nations. I will sing praises to you among the peoples.","tok":[{"t":"I","s":["H5782"]},{"t":" will give thanks "},{"t":"to","s":["H7837"]},{"t":" you, "},{"t":"LORD","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":", among "},{"t":"the","s":["H5782"]},{"t":" nations. "},{"t":"I","s":["H5782"]},{"t":" will sing praises "},{"t":"to","s":["H7837"]},{"t":" you among "},{"t":"the","s":["H5782"]},{"t":" peoples."}]},{"n":4,"text":"For your loving kindness is great above the heavens. Your faithfulness reaches to the skies.","tok":[{"t":"For","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" loving kindness "},{"t":"is","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" great above "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" heavens. "},{"t":"Your","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" faithfulness reaches "},{"t":"to","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" skies."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Be exalted, God, above the heavens! Let your glory be over all the earth.","tok":[{"t":"Be","s":["H8064"],"a":[2]},{"t":" exalted, "},{"t":"God","s":["H8064"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"above","s":["H5921"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5921"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"heavens","s":["H8064"]},{"t"